<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><b>Proposal No. 4 &#8211; To consider and vote upon
a proposed amendment of the Company&#8217;s certificate of incorporation to effect a reverse stock split of the Company&#8217;s Common
Stock, at a ratio to be determined by our board of directors, in its discretion, but within the range of 1/1.5 and 1/20, if needed to
regain compliance with Nasdaq Rule 5550(a)(2), which requires the minimum bid price of our common stock to be at least $1.00. </b></p>

